  "panels": [
    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "Use this dashboard from top to bottom. The first rows answer whether the gateway is being scraped, whether users are protected, and whether model capacity is reduced. Later rows explain why: hidden failures, participant quality, no-send slots, and timeout work. Empty data usually means one of three things: Prometheus cannot scrape `devshard-gateway`, the gateway image is older than the metrics change, or no `/v1/chat/completions` traffic has hit the gateway in the selected time range.\n\nGlossary: a user request is what the client sees. An attempt is one real participant send. A hidden failure is a failed attempt protected by another successful attempt. A slot decision is a real send or a no-send burn. Scale factor is current model capacity divided by steady-state model capacity.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Read This First",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 2,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "At a Glance",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "1 means Prometheus can scrape the gateway. 0 or no data means the dashboard cannot trust the other panels yet.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "down"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "up"
                }
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "up{job=\"devshard-gateway\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Gateway Scrape",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Total user request rate observed by the gateway.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 2,
          "unit": "rps"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(devshard_gateway_requests_total{model=~\"$model\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "User Requests / sec",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Share of gateway requests that ended as success or cache hit.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 2,
          "max": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "percentunit"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 9,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(devshard_gateway_requests_total{model=~\"$model\",outcome=~\"success|cached\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(devshard_gateway_requests_total{model=~\"$model\"}[$__rate_interval])), 0.001)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "User Success Rate",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "User-visible failures that should stay near zero.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 3,
          "unit": "rps"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(devshard_gateway_critical_user_failures_total{model=~\"$model\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Critical Failures / sec",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Lowest current capacity percentage among selected models. 1 means full capacity; 0.5 means half of steady-state capacity.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 2,
          "max": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "percentunit"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 19,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "min(devshard_gateway_capacity_scale_by_model{model=~\"$model\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Worst Model Capacity",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Top reasons currently affecting users or forcing protective work. Each target is separate so sparse reasons remain visible.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "id": 8,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(5, sum(rate(devshard_gateway_critical_user_failures_total{model=~\"$model\",reason=~\"$reason\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (reason))",
          "legendFormat": "user failure: {{reason}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "topk(5, sum(rate(devshard_gateway_user_requests_with_hidden_failure_total{model=~\"$model\",reason=~\"$reason\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (reason))",
          "legendFormat": "hidden failure: {{reason}}",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "topk(5, sum(rate(devshard_gateway_timeout_actions_total{model=~\"$model\",action=~\"skipped|failed\",reason=~\"$reason\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (reason))",
          "legendFormat": "timeout work: {{reason}}",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Top Current Problem Reasons",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
